        "source": "valmikiramayan.net",
        "net_locator": "1-4-10",
        "spans_beyond_this_verse": false,
        "text": "The gandharva-s are celestial beings with adorable personalities and performers of all kinds of performing arts. Hence, Indian musical art is termed as gaandhava-vidyaa."
